# Vendor status state machine

No vendor may receive a job dispatch until status = **ACTIVE** *and* capacity is accepting work.
**Account status** (Pending → Active) is separate from **capacity** (Paused / weekly cap).
A vendor can be ACTIVE (verified) but PAUSED (not accepting new jobs). Existing scheduled jobs are unaffected by PAUSE.

## Capacity SMS / portal

| Command | Effect |
|---|---|
| Reply **PAUSE** | Capacity paused — no new jobs. Scheduled jobs unchanged. |
| Reply **RESUME** | Capacity active — dispatch resumes. Confirmation SMS sent. |
| Reply **JOBS MAX n** | Weekly job cap = n. Auto-pauses when the week’s assignments hit the cap. |
| Portal toggle on `/v/:token` | Same as PAUSE / RESUME. |

## COI & license expiration

| Trigger | Action | Result |
|---|---|---|
| 30 days before | SMS warning + renewal link (`/v/:token`) | ACTIVE |
| 7 days before | 2nd SMS + Ulo ops notified | ACTIVE |
| Expiry date | Auto-SUSPENDED (`vendors.roster_status`) | SUSPENDED |
| New COI/license verified | Clear suspension → ACTIVE | ACTIVE |

Cron: `check-vendor-compliance-expiry` (daily). Idempotent via `compliance_expiry_notices`.

## Performance standards (§7)

| Metric | Threshold | Consequence |
|---|---|---|
| Avg rating (5+ jobs) | &lt; 3.5 | Coaching (`performance_review = coaching`) + SMS + ops |
| Avg rating — continued | &lt; 3.0 after coaching | Suspension review (ops urgent; not auto-suspend) |
| No-show | &gt;2 in 30 days | Warning SMS + ops |
| No-show — continued | &gt;3 in 60 days | Suspension review |
| Job acceptance | &lt; 40% over 20+ offers | Profile review |
| Misconduct Class A/B | Any | Immediate `roster_status = suspended` |

Cron: `check-vendor-performance-standards` (daily). No-shows from confirmed appointments that lapse without progress (`vendor_job_no_shows`). Misconduct: `report-vendor-misconduct`.

## Incident protocols (pre-launch gates)

Matching requires **ACTIVE** *and* the **same trade**. Nothing enters the queue without both (`isVendorMatchableForDispatch` / `pickVendorForAssignment`). If there is no matching Active vendor, leave the job unassigned and use **Find External Vendor**.

| Protocol | Key rule | Implementation |
|---|---|---|
| **1 — No-Show** | T+120 landlord+tenant notified; T+125 rematch. Automated 2-hr window. | `check-vendor-incident-protocols` (every 5 min) |
| **2 — Property Damage** | $1M COI + Ulo Additional Insured; Ulo does not pay claims; suspend pending review | Checklist gate + `report-property-damage` |
| **3 — Bad Actor** | Suspend immediately before investigation; Class A founder call ≤15 min; permanent bans permanent | `report-vendor-misconduct` / `ban-vendor` |

## Meaning & rules

| Status | Meaning |
|---|---|
| **NOT ACTIVATED** | On roster only. Verification invite not sent yet. Not matchable. |
| **WAITING FOR VENDOR** | Invite sent (`invited` / `in_progress`). Not matchable until verified. |
| **DOCS SUBMITTED** | Docs under review. Not matchable. Target: 48hrs (manual), 24hrs post-Checkr. |
| **ACTIVE** | Requirements met, **or** landlord **Override onboarding**. Enters matching queue. Only matchable state. |
| **PAUSED** | Vendor-initiated hold. No new jobs. Self-reactivate via SMS or portal. |
| **SUSPENDED** | Platform hold: incident, performance breach, or expired COI/license. Review in 1–2hrs. |
| **BANNED** | Permanent removal. No reinstatement. Data retained for audit. |

## Mapping from data

| Chip | Source |
|---|---|
| Not activated | No `vendor_verifications` row yet (manual outreach not sent) |
| Waiting for vendor | `vendor_verifications.status` in `invited` / `in_progress` |
| Docs submitted | `vendor_verifications.status` in `submitted` / `needs_review` |
| Active | `status = verified` **or** `vendors.onboarding_overridden_at` set, and accepting work (`availability != paused`, `vendors.active != false`) |
| Paused | Verified or overridden, but `availability = paused` or `vendors.active = false` |
| Suspended | `vendors.roster_status = suspended` (overrides verification) |
| Banned | `vendors.roster_status = banned` (overrides verification) |

## Implementation

- Resolver: `src/lib/vendorStatusChip.ts` → `resolveVendorCapacityChip` / `isVendorMatchable`
- UI chips: `AdminVendorsDashboard`, `AdminVendorDetailDashboard`, `vendorComplianceProfile`
- Matching: `pickVendorForAssignment` must only consider matchable (ACTIVE) vendors **in the same trade**. If no matching trade is Active, leave the job unassigned and use **Find External Vendor** — never last-resort a different trade.
- Never show **Active** while verification is incomplete, unless the landlord used **Override onboarding**
- Hide **Start onboarding** once the vendor is no longer Not activated (invite sent, form submitted, verified, or **Override onboarding**)
- Override does **not** mark `vendor_verifications.status = verified` and does **not** send an invite
- Override makes the vendor matchable immediately (`onboarding_overridden_at`), closes the vendor onboarding workflow so Ulo does not keep asking for the verification form, and dispatches open unassigned work orders through the same assignment path as a new ticket
- Override texts the vendor that their profile is active (best-effort SMS; skip if no phone)
- Override requires a checkbox acknowledgement (v2 copy, with Terms §6.2 and §10 links). Activate writes `vendor_onboarding_override_acks` (timestamps, landlord id, session token, exact disclaimer text + version) before setting `onboarding_overridden_at`
- Onboarding auto-invite starts vendors in **Pending** until they finish the verification form

